  "description": "NetMetric.SystemIO.DependencyInjection provides extension methods for integrating system I/O metrics collection into .NET applications using\n\t\t\tMicrosoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection. It detects the current operating system and registers the appropriate IProcessIoReader and\n\t\t\tISystemIoReader implementations for Windows, Linux, or macOS, enabling modular and platform-specific observability support.",
